    "details": {
      "alignment": "Neutral",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "Toad"
      },
      "cr": 2,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Mistveil.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. XP ledger: level 3, power rating 5 → CR 2 as a operative. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Loyalist Who Extracts Secrets</strong> — Peach Loyalists (Intelligence Operative)</p><p>Status: Active — operating undercover in various capacities</p><p>Mistveil is one of Captain Toadette's most effective intelligence operatives—a specialist in infiltration, extraction, and the acquisition of secrets that powerful people prefer to keep hidden. At Fawful's gala, Mistveil posed as a minor noble and extracted Chief Thornpaw's confirmation of his relationship with Princess Peach—testimony that validated decades of Loyalist theories. The conversation lasted approximately thirty minutes and produced more actionable intelligence than some operatives gather in years. Waluigi respects professional excellence even when it serves factions whose methods disturb him. Mistveil is professionally excellent. Mistveil is also absolutely dedicated to Captain Toadette's vision, which means Mistveil is DANGEROUS in ways that go beyond mere competence. WAH.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Dagger</strong> — “The Loyalist Who Extracts Secrets”</li><li><strong>Hidden in Plain Sight</strong> — “Mistveil is one of Captain Toadette's most effective intelligence operatives—a specialist in infiltration, extraction, and the acquisition of secrets that powerful people prefer to keep hidden.”</li><li><strong>Sneak Attack</strong> — “Yet the intelligence opportunity was too significant to ignore—Chief Thornpaw was attending, and Thornpaw potentially held information about the assassination that no one else possessed.”</li><li><strong>Silver Tongue</strong> — “What is consistent across accounts: Infiltration Expertise: Mistveil can adopt personas convincingly enough to pass in hostile environments.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/mistveil</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/mistveil</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
